#: profiles/default/consent.php:12
msgid "Consent to the processing of personal data"
msgstr "Privola za obradu osobnih podataka"

#: profiles/default/consent.php:14
msgid "By ticking below I choose which messages I want to receive from {0} (the \"Controller\") at my contact details. For commercial communications I also give the Controller my consent to sending them and to processing my contact details for this purpose."
msgstr "Označavanjem u nastavku biram koje poruke želim primati od {0} (u daljnjem tekstu „Voditelj obrade“) na svoje kontaktne podatke. Za poslovne obavijesti time Voditelju obrade ujedno dajem privolu za njihovo slanje i za obradu svojih kontaktnih podataka u tu svrhu."

#: profiles/default/consent.php:15
msgid "I can change or withdraw my choice and consent at any time, here in the customer portal or through the contact details of the Controller. Withdrawing does not affect the lawfulness of the processing before it."
